/**
 * AP African American Studies — Exit Quiz Question Pool
 * 15–17 items per routed topic, aligned to the four CED units
 * (Origins of the African Diaspora; Freedom, Enslavement, and Resistance;
 * The Practice of Freedom; Movements and Debates).
 *
 * Feeds: each topic's exit quiz (by topicSlug), the course diagnostic and the
 * unit tests (by domain), and the daily question.
 *  - `part` is the lesson part that teaches the item; a failed exit quiz uses it
 *    to send the student back to that part.
 *  - Options are parallel in form and similar in length; the key is not
 *    systematically the longest or shortest option.
 *  - Source excerpts marked "adapted from" are paraphrased or shortened.
 */

